Subject: [PATCH] feat: support fixed access-token claims

Allow module-owned clients to request constrained string claims with
built-in mappers. Preserve unrelated configuration, secrets and disabled
state, including retry after interrupted mapper reconciliation.

Keep password, implicit and service-account grants disabled. Add schema,
regression and real Keycloak token checks, with registration docs.

